。</span></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1643213219083" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1643213219083" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1633095599190" data-id="1633095599190"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1643213218983" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1643213218983"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1><strong>Event Information</strong></h1></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1633095974244" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1633095974244" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1633095888378" data-id="1633095888378"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1633098448459" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1633098448459" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/5d948c9a-0049-4838-8343-09231b20190f/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/KK_21_FFB2-1%20_1_.jpeg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1920" height="1394" natural-width="1920" natural-height="1394"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1633095890809" data-id="1633095890809"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1633095974219" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1633095974219"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-